      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Right click VRChat on steam -> Properties -> Local Files -> Browse Local Files -> VrChat Data -> Plugins -> delete: AudioPluginOculusSpatializer.dll\n\nOculus blacklisted older cpu's/gpu's so they dont work with the headset, and I guess it also carries on to the plugins. After you delete this it should be fine.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
